ile overlooking the vast ocean, sparkling city & harbor lights, Vincent Thomas bridge, & beautiful sunrises!  This versatile home has next-gen living potential, offering 2 entries, 2 kitchens, 2 loft bedroom areas, 2 indoor laundry or hook-up areas, one has a sink & built in cabinets, 2 main level bedrooms, 3 main level bathrooms, 2 car attached garage, on a spacious half acre plus, lot with breathtaking views!  This charming customized home also still has many original features such as hard wood floors with inlay, & built in storage cabinetry. Some upgrades include recessed lighting, PV stonework fire places, & outdoor built-in BBQ with panoramic views! (SHOWN BY APPOINTMENT ONLY)","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Loft, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please e-mail with your requested appointment time & POF/financial qualifications with 24 hour notice please,(per seller). Once seller confirms your requested time, I will share the Supra location & CBS code & confirm your appointment. Please don't use showingtime. (Sellers have variable work schedules, sometimes day sleepers, & DOG!)","False","","","","2600","Owner","","CA","Coming Soon","Two","","","Toprail","","5","","","","Cash, Conventional","","07091","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","https://siteviewmedia.hd.pics/x2357513","https://youtu.be/QAi2sRDZ7Gs?si=k_BK5lJnYlIShGEc","","1952","90275","",""
