ith seamless indoor-outdoor living. Spanning approximately 2,677 square feet, the open-concept floor plan offers 4 spacious bedrooms and 3.5 elegantly appointed bathrooms. The primary suite is a true retreat, featuring serene ocean views and a spa-inspired bathroom. Designed for both everyday living and entertaining, the expansive living and dining areas open effortlessly through two 12-foot frameless glass folding doors, flooding the home with natural light and creating a seamless connection to the outdoors. At the heart of the home is a chef's dream kitchen, highlighted by a dramatic 14-foot island with high-end porcelain countertops, a 48-inch Thermador cooktop, double ovens, a microwave drawer, and a 48-inch built-in refrigerator. Step outside to your private backyard oasis-featuring a newly resurfaced pool, brand-new deck, and sweeping coastal views that make every moment feel like a getaway. No detail has been overlooked: the home also boasts a new roof, updated exterior siding, and fully upgraded electrical and plumbing systems. Car enthusiasts will appreciate the finished garage with durable polycuramine flooring and high-speed EV charging capabilities. Award wining Palos Verdes schools with access to Mira Catalina elementary, Miraleste Intermediate and your choice of PV or Peninsula high schools. This is coastal living at its finest-luxurious, modern, and truly unforgettable.","","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Entry, Foyer, Game Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","CALL AGENT FOR DETAILS","","","","True","2677","Assessor","","CA","Coming Soon","One","","","Ganado","","30481","","","Modern","Contract","","27611","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","","","","1964","90275","",""
