stline. Proudly offered by only its third owner, this 5-bedroom, 3-bath home blends warmth, function, and an exceptional lifestyle location. A welcoming formal entry opens to a gracious living room with wood floors and an elegant fireplace, while the formal dining room is ideal for hosting family and friends. Large sliding glass doors connect the interior living spaces to the lush backyard, creating effortless indoor-outdoor flow. The spacious kitchen is equipped with quality appliances including a Fisher & Paykel dishwasher, KitchenAid microwave and stovetop, and refrigerator. A main-level bedroom suite with adjoining bath offers flexibility for guests, extended family, or a home office. Upstairs, four additional bedrooms and two remodeled baths enjoy beautiful ocean views. Recent improvements include Pella windows and sliding doors, updated plumbing, tankless water heater, custom closets throughout, newer carpet, and remodeled upstairs and downstairs baths. Designer touches such as Schonbek light fixtures add elegance and sophistication. The private backyard is a true retreat with a flat grassy play area, manicured gardens, covered dining area, fire pit, and a custom playset. Additional features include a concrete tile roof, new irrigation and drainage system, and attached 2-car garage. Located in the top-ranked Palos Verdes Unified School District, and just a short stroll to Vista Grande Elementary and Hesse Park, this home also enjoys a prime location minutes from shopping, grocery stores, and restaurants. A rare opportunity to own a special home in one of Palos Verdes? most desirable neighborhoods.","","Attic, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","IN COMPLIACNCE WITH MLS ""COMING SOON"" RULES, ABSOLUTELY NO SHOWING UNTIL MLS STATUS CHANGES TO ""ACTIVE"". Please DO NOT ASK. After we go live on MLS, Tenant occupied. Please 