nd comfort come together with rich hardwood floors, dramatic Italian marble stone steps, abundant natural light, and a striking stone fireplace anchoring the living space. The designer chef?s kitchen is appointed with premium Viking appliances, sleek quartz countertops, custom cabinetry, a 100+ bottle built-in wine refrigerator, beverage fridge, and dedicated wine storage?ideal for everyday living and effortless entertaining. The spa-inspired bathrooms offer a true resort feel, including a luxurious steam shower and an exquisite primary suite retreat featuring a Mr. Steam spa-style soaking experience with serene ocean views. Custom closets enhance every bedroom, along with upgraded storage solutions and a built-in safe securely bolted in place. The fully renovated garage adds valuable flexibility with a functional mudroom and private office, perfectly suited for today?s lifestyle. Additional upgrades include heavy-duty doors, all new windows and sliding glass doors, a stunning new front entry, smooth stucco exterior, new heating furnace, tankless water heater, whole-home water purification and filtration system, drip irrigation, and an electric vehicle charger. Outdoor living is equally impressive with two beautifully finished patios with proper drainage, a custom driveway, new retaining wall, all-turf yard, and gas line for an outdoor grill?creating a private setting for entertaining or relaxing in the coastal breeze. Modern security features include a fully hardwired CCTV surveillance system and Ring doorbell. Located in one of the South Bay?s most prestigious coastal communities, this exceptional property offers a rare opportunity to enjoy luxury living just moments from scenic ocean bluffs, top-rated schools, and the charm of Lunada Bay.","Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Bonus Room, Den, Dressing Area, Family Room, Game Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Luna