evels and nearly every room, creating a constant connection to the Pacific. As the automatic gate opens, you arrive through manicured hedges and colorful stonework to a residence that immediately impresses with its timeless French architecture, beautifully curated grounds, and three-car garage. Gray brick pavers lead to a dramatic double-door entry where soaring ceilings and a striking spiral staircase set the tone for the home?s grand scale and light-filled interiors. Just off the entry is a formal study with its own private entrance. Beyond, the living room opens to a full-width balcony framing expansive ocean and sunset views?an unforgettable focal point and a backdrop enjoyed throughout the day. The main level also features a formal dining room, a chef?s kitchen with high-end appliances, walk-in pantry, and eat in kitchen, a spacious laundry room with extensive storage, direct access to the three-car garage, and a guest bedroom adjacent to a newly updated bathroom?all enhanced by elevated ceiling heights and sweeping coastal vistas. Upstairs, the primary suite is a serene retreat with French doors and two Juliet balconies showcasing spectacular ocean and sunset views. The luxurious en-suite bath includes dual sinks, a large walk-in shower, soaking tub, water closet, and separate his-and-hers closets. Two additional bedrooms and a full bathroom complete this level, each enjoying the home?s signature light, volume, and views. Designed to comfortably accommodate multi-generational living, the lower level functions as a private living space of its own. This level includes a generous family room with 12' beamed ceilings, wood-burning fireplace, wet bar, hobby or workout room, and French doors opening directly to the brick backyard. Outdoors, enjoy an above-ground spa and built-in BBQ?perfect for relaxed coastal entertaining. Two bedrooms and two bathrooms complete this level, offering flexibility for extended family, guests, or long-term living arrangements. A rare opportunity to experience true joie de vivre in an exceptional ocean- and sunset-view residence where space, views, and architectural elegance converge.","Tile","Family Room, Library, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Reach out to Janet or Cameron at 424-241-3311 to make an appointment, or set it up with Showing Time.","False","Above Ground","True","","5298","Assessor","","CA","Active","Three Or More ","","","Via Castilla","","1413","","","French","Submit","","27438","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=JxyBw7251qr","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=JxyBw7251qr","","1980","90274","2850","PVR1*"
