and step into a spacious grand foyer, where a dramatic spiral staircase sets the tone for the elegance found throughout the home.  Designed for both comfort and sophistication, this residence features three stately fireplaces, custom-crafted ceilings, and French doors that bathe the interior in natural light while opening seamlessly to outdoor living spaces.  The dream kitchen is a chef?s delight?complete with premium appliances, rich cabinetry, granite counters, custom backsplash, center island with breakfast bar, large walk-in pantry, and a dedicated wine chiller for effortless entertaining.  The home features 5 bedrooms with one suite on the main level. The main primary suite features panoramic views, fireplace, plus large bath and dream closet. A second primary suite also has panoramic views.  Every detail reflects refined craftsmanship and timeless style, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere within this luxurious estate. Perfect for those seeking serenity, beauty, and coastal grandeur.","","Center Hall, Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Very flexible for showings.","True","None","False","True","5576","Other","","CA","Active","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","3004","","","Mediterranean","Conventional","","7112","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected","Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=PDJfzhinjEx&mls=1","","Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, Skylight(s)","2011","90274","",""
"","0.2442","Text agent to show","Built-In, Dishwasher, Disposal, Microwave, Range, Range Hood, Refrigerator","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","","False","7541005011","","","","False","4","0","0","0","4","5","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","","","Los Angeles","61","5500000","#ERR","02/04/2026 12:12:37 PM","","","","02/12/2026 6:04:09 AM","","","02/04/2026 12:00:00 AM","","02/04/2026 12:05:17 PM","","02/04/2026 12:00:00 AM","","West","61","","","Breakfast Counter / Bar","","","","","","Cash","Living Room","True","Wood","False","Central","True","Wet Bar","True","True","No Key Safe","","","","False","","33.782629","Inside, Washer Included","True","False","","Homeowners Association","5500000","","","5500000","#ERR","310-544-5129","","suzannetdyer@gmail.com","","Suzanne","","","Dyer","","CLW-X21002","","","","","CLW-X83814","310-545-0771","Strand Hill Properties","310-545-0707","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.419858","59x184","","10637","Back Yard, Front Yard, Lawn, Yard","","","","","","26647461","","3","3","","","Vacant","","","","","Circular Driveway, Driveway, Garage - Three Door, Private","True","","","50","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1260.6","New or extensively remodeled homes are extraordinarily rare in Palos Verdes Estates, where the permit and building process is famously lengthy and complex. This is a unique opportunity to simply turn the key and move into a home where an over two-million-dollar, ground-up remodel has recently been completed.Perfectly positioned on one of the Peninsula's most prestigious and sought-after streets, Paseo Del Mar, this stunning residence is a true collaboration of exceptional design, craftsmanship, and livability.  Every element has been thoughtfully curated, from the custom cabinetry and exquisite stone and tile finishes to the refined architectural details that elevate the home throughout. Walls of glass create a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living, capturing ocean views, cooling sea breezes, and effortless access to multiple private patios. A sweeping circular driveway welcomes you home, framed by a tranquil water feature and elegant courtyard arrival experience that immediately sets the tone. At the heart of the home is a beautifully designed kitchen that flows effortlessly into the family room and out to the expansive backyard, complete with a serene waterfall feature ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. The formal dining room is highlighted by a striking Jamie Young chandelier, while the great room features a wet bar with Scotsman icemaker and dramatic fireplace, opening gracefully to outdoor spaces for gatherings large and small. The primary suite is a private retreat, offering ocean views, its own patio, a spa-like bath, and an exceptional walk-in closet. Three additional bedrooms on the upper level each enjoy patio access, while a fifth bedroom or office on the main level offers flexibility for guests or work-from-home living. A 507-square-foot bonus room or weight room/playroom/office provides endless possibilities and can easily be converted into a remarkable ADU and a discreet 252-square-foot wine room adds yet another layer of luxury for the enthusiast (bonus room is included in total square footage). The property also features a three-car garage plus additional off-street parking accessed from the alley behind the home an invaluable convenience on Paseo Del Mar. The backyard offers ample space for a pool and spa, or can be enjoyed as a spacious lawn and patio retreat.Completely reimagined from the foundation up using the finest materials and craftsmanship, this home represents the pinnacle of modern coastal living. Residents also enjoy the opportunity to join the Palos Verdes Golf & Tennis Club and the Palos Verdes Beach & Athletic Club, further enhancing the lifestyle that makes Palos Verdes Estates so special.  Conveniently located close to the elementary, middle, and high schools.","","Basement, Bonus Room, Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Jack & Jill, Living Room, Office, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: Text LA 1 ","True","None","False","","4363","Plans","","CA","Active","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","1736","","","","Cash","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=fywZWdcNyJY","","","2023","90274","1854","PVR1*"
"","0.3899","All data, including measurements and area calculations, is obtained from various sources and has not been, and will not be, verified by Broker or MLS. All information should be independently reviewed and verified for accuracy.","Built-In, Dishwasher, Electric Oven, Disposal, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator, Self Cleaning Oven, Vented Exhaust Fan","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","","False","7543047013","","","","False","7","1","0","5","1","5","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","310-273-7077","","JJ@Wallack.com","310-775-2311","J.J.","","","Wallack","CLW-C136798","","","","","","CLW-X74054","310-432-6401","Keller Williams Beverly Hills","310-432-6400","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","","","Los Angeles","39","9495000","#ERR","02/26/2026 11:26:24 AM","","","","03/31/2026 6:18:34 AM","","","02/26/2026 12:00:00 AM","","02/26/2026 9:51:59 AM","","02/26/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","39","Sliding Doors","","Dining Room","","","","","","Cash","Game Room, Living Room, Electric, Gas","True","Wood","","Central","True","High Ceilings, Intercom, Living Room Balcony, Open Floorplan, Recessed Lighting, Storage","True","True","No Key Safe","None","","","","","33.779291","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Washer Included","True","False","","","9495000","","","9495000","#ERR","310-922-6573","","ethanschultz@kw.com","","Ethan","","","Schultz","","CLW-C142896","","","","","CLW-X74054","310-432-6401","Keller Williams Beverly Hills","310-432-6400","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.405128","114 x 149","","16986","","","","Assessor","","","26656799","","3","3","","","","","","","","Deck, Garage - Single Door, Garage - Two Door","True","","","55","","","","Close Of Escrow","1540.15","New Construction Ocean View Paradise in Palos Verdes Estates. Escape to calm and serenity in this custom luxury-built quiet retreat. While taking maximum advantage of the amazing ocean views from every room, the home has been ""built to live in"" which is that warm feeling you get throughout the property. Floor to high-ceiling Fleetwood doors are on every level, opening to showcase the massive entertainment decks and beautiful ocean water. The main level great room can accommodate any configuration needed, from small intimate dining to grand entertaining. The gourmet kitchen incorporates stunning Italian porcelain countertops, Wolf appliances, a buffet island for dining, and a complete auxiliary butler's kitchen. Relax outdoors under the pitch-black night sky which is perfect for stargazing, with a sense of calm and quiet all around you. The bottom deck has a PebbleTec pool and spa with a cozy firepit area. Framed with mostly steel construction across all floors, the walls have been insulated with careful attention paid to soundproofing. Elevator-equipped for easy access to all levels. Bang & Olufsen speakers provide an audiophile level of music enjoyment that can be controlled from your smartphone. The home also features a 26 kilowatt solar panel system that comes with the property. Plenty of parking is available on the entry level, as well as separate 1 and 2 car garages. There is also an attached, full-kitchen ADU, accessed from the bottom level.  Square footage includes a 325 SF theater room and a 185 SF walk-in closet and server room which were created from storage space not in the original plans.","Tile","Basement, Entry, Formal Entry, Great Room, Home Theatre, Living Room, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Call Listing Agent 1. 24-hour notice. Showing Information: Text LA 1,24-hr Notice,Call LA 1 ","False","In Ground","True","","6165","Plans","","CA","Active","Multi/Split ","","","Via Leon","","1565","","","Modern","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport