y appointed secondary bedrooms offer generous proportions and supreme comfort. Designed for the entertainer, the second story also features an expansive game room with a wet bar and concealed drop-down screen. On the lower basement level, a custom-crafted wine room serves as a sophisticated retreat for billiards and showcasing fine vintages. Outside, the resort-style grounds offer the ultimate indoor-outdoor lifestyle. Step into a lush oasis featuring a sparkling pool and spa, fireside lounges, heat lamps, and a fully equipped outdoor kitchen and bar. A recently resurfaced championship tennis court features a dedicated viewing terrace / cabana, while illuminated pathways lead to serene, hidden vegetable gardens. Offering an unparalleled standard of living within the highly rated Palos Verdes Peninsula school district, this extraordinary property is a rare opportunity to experience prestigious coastal luxury.","Tile","Bonus Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Jack & Jill, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Property is occupied by seller. All showings by appointment only. 24-48 hour notice required prior to showings. Please text listing agent Kevin Megowan at (310) 956-0590 to make appointments for all showings","","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","7556","Public Records","","CA","Active","One, Two","","","Paseo La Cresta","","1502","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","8043","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Panoramic, Park/Greenbelt","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/story/490354/u","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=4WvaTcySwsy&brand=0","Casement Windows, Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, Drapes, Skylight(s)","2000","90274","","PVR1YY"
