sor","","","PV26044153","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Garage, Garage Door Opener, Side by Side","True","Patio Open, Stone, Wrap Around","True","62","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1351.77","A rare opportunity to own one of Malaga Cove?s most compelling view properties, this custom, Spanish-inspired estate captures panoramic Queen?s Necklace and white-water ocean views while enjoying exceptional privacy adjacent to parkland within Palos Verdes Estates. Completed in 2025, the remodel blends timeless architecture with modern infrastructure and artfully appointed finishes, including white smooth plaster walls with a Venetian wax finish, expansive 8-foot bifold doors spanning 15?18 feet, custom-sized milled hickory pecan herringbone flooring, limestone floors in Versailles and herringbone patterns, and solid glazed alder cabinetry with extensive built-ins. Designed as a true culinary pavilion, the ocean-view kitchen opens to the family room and sits adjacent to the dining room for seamless entertaining. It features premium appliances, dual sinks, dual dishwashers, two refrigerator/freezers, including a 60-inch commercial unit, and generous prep space. A fully equipped dirty kitchen supports effortless hosting, while the exterior kitchen ? complete with built-in smoker/BBQ, Argentinian grill, and a 60-inch wood-fired pizza oven ? extends the experience outdoors. The dining room showcases a striking glass-encased wine cellar with a cellar pantry and abundant wine glass storage, opening to a patio with a gas fire feature overlooking the coastline. A beautifully appointed living room with a fireplace provides refined comfort nearby. The lower level offers a private retreat with a luxurious primary suite capturing breathtaking panoramic coastline vistas. The spa-inspired bath includes an 8-valve shower system with an oversized 8x24-inch main shower head and additional wall heads, plus warm flooring throughout. A custom primary closet completes the suite. Additional bedrooms provide privacy for family or guests. Below, a serene spa overlooks the coastline and a lush orchard featuring avocado, cherry, plum, apricot, apple, Meyer lemon, Baer lime, mandarin, blood orange, Buddha?s hand, Seville orange, pomegranate, fig, nectarine, peach, donut peach, guava, and bay leaf. A private path leads directly to the walking trail below. With fully upgraded water, sewer, gas, electrical, and heating systems, upsized water lines, and exceptional additional storage, this residence delivers rare views, privacy, craftsmanship, and elevated coastal living.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Galley Kitchen, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Easy to Show To show, please Call or Text Virginia Butler 310-849-1779 or Rae Lord at 310-947-1667 to receive the CBS code.","","Private, Above Ground, Heated","True","","3906","Plans","","CA","Active","Three Or More ","","","Via Arriba","","1801","","","Spanish","Contract","","6884","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Sewer Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Park/Greenbelt, Water, White Water","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/b2a6390e-9e95-4078-97fd-c8f344ebf8e4?setAttribution=mls&wl=true&initialViewType=pano&utm_source=dashboard","","Double Pane Windows","1970","90274","",""
