rs, windows, roof, and air conditioning, offering modern performance and peace of mind. An expansive private courtyard leads to a dramatic entry, where an oversized pivot door opens to a light-filled interior. The gourmet kitchen showcases custom Italian cabinetry and granite countertops, seamlessly connecting to the main living space. Oversized picture windows and sliding glass doors frame unobstructed north-facing views and open to a generous view deck, creating effortless indoor-outdoor flow. A wood-burning fireplace anchors the living area with warmth and architectural presence.  Owner may carry paper! The primary suite is a refined retreat, featuring a luxurious bathroom with glass tile and marble inlay, a large walk-in closet, and a private laundry room. The lower level offers three additional ensuite bedrooms, providing comfort, privacy, and flexibility. Beyond the main living spaces, the property offers two large, flat yard areas, an exceptional feature in Malaga Cove.  The spacious side patio is anchored by a fireplace, creating multiple spaces for entertaining, play, and everyday enjoyment. A striking floating staircase connects the home to the two-car garage and view landing, completing this thoughtfully designed residence where architecture, modern amenities, and extraordinary views converge.","Clay","Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appointment.","True","None","False","","3800","Estimated","","CA","Active","Three Or More ","","","Via Somonte","","728","","","Contemporary","Cash to New Loan, Owner May Carry","","6884","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, White Water","True","https://players.brightcove.net/5782667246001/default_default/index.html?videoId=6388454336112","","","2026","90274","",""
"","0.5596","All information provided is deemed reliable but not guaranteed. Buyer to independently verify all facts, including square footage, lot size, permits, and property condition. The owners pay $50.00 a year to one of the property owners on the street in order to pay for electricity to street lights at the entrance to Yellow Brick Rd. No Formal HOA exists.","6 Burner Stove, Barbecue, Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Freezer, Gas Oven, Gas Cooktop, Ice Maker, Microwave, Refrigerator, Warming Drawer, Water Heater Central, Water Softener","True","163 - Malaga Cove","None","False","7546022013","","0","","False","7","2","","4","1","5","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","310-986-9642","","dean@caskeyrealestategroup.com","","Dean","","","Alessi","SBALESDEA","","","","","","SB1338520","925-262-1177","eXp Realty of California Inc","888-584-9427","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Direct Ph","","","","Central Air, Dual","True","Los Angeles","70","8200000","#ERR","01/26/2026 6:46:32 PM","","","","03/24/2026 12:27:49 PM","","","01/25/2026 12:00:00 AM","","03/24/2026 12:27:49 PM","","01/25/2026 12:00:00 AM","","Northwest","70","French Doors","False","Dining Room, In Kitchen, Separated","Balcony, Barbecue Private","Brick, Concrete, Plaster, Stone, Stucco","Stone","True","","","Bath, Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Outside, Patio, Gas, Wood Burning, See Through, Two Way","True","Stone, Wood","True","Central","True","2 Staircases, Balcony, Bar, Beamed Ceilings, Brick Walls, Built-in Features, Coffered Ceiling(s), Dry Bar, Elevator, In-Law Floorplan, Intercom, Living Room Deck Attached, Open Floorplan, Pantry, Recessed Lighting, Stone Counters, Two Story Ceilings, Wet Bar, Wired for Data, Wired for Sound","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.794228","Dryer Included, In Garage, Inside, Upper Level, Washer Included","True","False","","","8200000","","","8200000","#ERR","310-200-1960","","dave@caskeyrealestategroup.com","","David","","","Caskey","","SCASKDAV","","","","","SB1366440","","eXp Realty of California Inc","310-374-1800","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.375702","","2","24378","0-1 Unit/Acre","Golf, Gutters, Horse Trails, Stable(s), Rural","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Security System, Smoke Detector(s), Wired for Alarm System","Assessor","","","SB26013765","","4","4","","1","Owner","","","","Second Garage Detached","Direct Garage Access, Driveway - Brick, Driveway Up Slope From Street, Garage, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Two Door","True","Deck, Patio, Stone, Terrace","True","40","","Private, Heated, Infinity, Salt Water, Waterfall","True","Close Of Escrow","1267.78","Available for the first time ever, 4 Yellow Brick Road is a custom Italianate estate tucked away on a private cul-de-sac shared by only seven homes. Defined by timeless architecture, exceptional craftsmanship, and sweeping coastal views, the residence stands as a true original. Designed by renowned architect Doug Leach, the home has been featured in magazines and commercials and has influenced multiple South Bay residences since its completion in 2005. Built as a forever home, the owners worked closely with the architect to create a floor plan that seamlessly balances multigenerational living with elevated entertaining. Spanning 6,468 square feet on an over half-acre lot, the home is thoughtfully oriented to capture 180-degree ocean and city views from nearly every room, creating a constant connection to its elevated setting. Ideally located within walking distance of the Palos Verdes Golf and Tennis Club and just minutes from Riviera Village and Redondo Beach, the property also offers convenient access to acclaimed restaurants and scenic coastal trails. The residence offers five bedrooms plus a library that functions as a sixth bedroom, along with seven bathrooms and an impressive collection of resort-style amenities. A Skip Phillips designed infinity pool and spa anchor the outdoor spaces, surrounded by lush gardens and multiple private areas for entertaining. Inside, a home theater with a 110-inch screen, two-stop elevator, and temperature-controlled wine cellar provide comfort and convenience. The chef?s kitchen features custom French Traditions cabinetry, Miele double ovens, a full-size Sub-Zero refrigerator, warming drawers, a built-in espresso machine, and an expansive butler?s pantry ideal for hosting memorable gatherings. Upstairs, the primary suite serves as a private retreat with double walk-in closets, a spa-like his-and-hers bathroom finished in honey onyx marble, and a jetted tub overlooking both Downtown Los Angeles and the Queen?s Necklace. Hand-selected finishes throughout include lighting by Fine Art, Belgard stone retaining walls, an Olympic stone pool deck, imported Italian tile and brick, walnut hardwood flooring, natural limestone, ceiling beams sourced from a historic French barn, and gates accented with wood imported from India. Rare and emotionally compelling, this is a home that must be experienced to be truly appreciated. An opportunity that comes along once in a lifetime.","Spanish Tile","Attic, Bonus Room, Converted Bedroom, Den, Formal Entry, Home Theatre, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call Dean Alessi or David Caskey for showing requests. 24-hour notice preferred, qualified buyers only. Agent must be present at all showings.","True","Heated","True","","6468","Assessor","","CA","Active","Two","","","Yellow Brick Rd","","4","","","See Remarks","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","29795","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Golf Course, Harbor, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Pier","True","","","French/Mullioned, Triple Pane Windows, Wood Frames","2005","90275","",""
