180-degree ocean views, offering a rare blend of serenity, privacy, and refined coastal living. Designed to harmonize with its breathtaking surroundings, the home effortlessly integrates indoor and outdoor spaces. Expansive sliding glass doors and overhead skylights bathe the interiors in natural light, while perfectly framing the ever-changing Pacific horizon. The main living area is both warm and sophisticated, centered around a wood-burning fireplace and enhanced by integrated Sonos sound throughout. The remodeled kitchen is equally suited for everyday living and elevated entertaining, appointed with premium appliances including an oversized Dacor range, Sub-Zero refrigeration, a Nespresso system, and a generous central island. The residence features four bedrooms and three well-appointed bathrooms, each equipped with Toto washlets. The primary suite offers a true sense of retreat, with stunning coastline views and a spacious bath complete with dual vanities, a soaking tub, and a separate shower. Outdoors, the property unfolds into a series of beautifully landscaped terraces designed for both relaxation and entertaining. A HotSpring spa, fireplace lounge overlooking the Pacific, dedicated dining area, and multiple seating vignettes create an inviting setting to take in the natural beauty of the coastline. Direct access to scenic bluff trails and the shoreline enhances a lifestyle centered around outdoor living, from quiet morning walks to surfing and coastal recreation. The exterior has been recently enhanced with a fresh repaint, new doors, and refined landscaping, further elevated by the addition of antique limestone troughs throughout the grounds. These thoughtful upgrades are not yet reflected in the current listing photography, with updated imagery coming soon.Offering both privacy and proximity, this tranquil retreat is just moments from Terranea Resort, world-class golf courses, and the finest amenities of the Palos Verdes Peninsula. Offered for both sale 