s. At the entrance, a fabulous large private front courtyard sets the tone?perfect for morning coffee, evening gatherings, or simply unwinding in your own outdoor sanctuary. Inside, a bright, flowing layout awaits, featuring a spacious living room, dining room, and kitchen, all with breathtaking views of rolling hills and lush green valley. The bedroom wing offers a tranquil primary suite, two additional bedrooms, and a beautifully refreshed main bathroom. Separately, the office can easily transform into the fourth bedroom to suit your needs. The lower level features a generously sized family room that flows seamlessly into a backyard oasis, ideal for entertaining. Surrounded by natural landscaping, the outdoor space includes a patio and offers direct access to the trail below. This level also boasts a spacious fifth bedroom with its own ensuite bathroom, a convenient laundry room, and a sizable storage room. Many upgrades throughout - new floors, freshly painted, new quartz countertops in the kitchen, 2 new bathroom vanities, new fixtures and fittings Located moments from the PV Golf & Tennis clubs, Palos Verdes Stables, and scenic trails, and within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula School District, this home offers the best of Valmonte living. Don't miss this rare opportunity!","Shingle","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Utility Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Call/Text Steve 310.418.1741 with date/time & copy of business card. **Open House Sat & Sun 3/14 & 3/15 1-4 PM, BO Tues 3/17 11-1 PM","True","None","False","True","2334","Assessor","","CA","Active","Two","","","Via Pinzon","","4240","","","","Cash to New Loan, Submit","","7143","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Canyon, H