s the home?s bright and airy feel. The beautiful gourmet kitchen features high ceilings, stainless steel appliances, breakfast area and a fun pass-through window designed to optimize effortless indoor-outdoor entertaining. The kitchen flows naturally into the spacious family room, making it the true heart of the home for gatherings both large and small. The primary suite includes a beautiful ensuite bathroom and walk in closet.  Step outside to your own private oasis, complete with a built-in outdoor kitchen with BBQ, inviting patio, and a sprawling grass lawn ideal for play or entertaining. Tucked around the corner, a dreamy ?secret garden? offers the perfect setting for a fire-pit, vegetable garden, or tranquil retreat under the trees. Enjoy quintessential Valmonte living with its picturesque tree-lined streets, close proximity to scenic trails, top-rated schools and just minutes from the beach and all that the Palos Verdes Peninsula lifestyle has to offer.","","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","TEXT Nicole @ 424-558-0476 to schedule a showing, 24 hours notice appreciated.","","","","","2436","Assessor","","CA","Active","One","","","Via Alcance","","300","","","","Cash, Conventional","","7143","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1950","90274","",""
