idence offers 4 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, and just under 4,000 square feet of living space on an expansive 13,384-square-foot lot. Enter through an antique Egyptian door into a private courtyard and a home rich with character and timeless elegance. The gourmet chef kitchen features Sub-Zero, Miele, and Wolf appliances, custom cabinetry, and striking antique chandeliers. A formal dining room opens to a stunning patio overlooking resort-like grounds, which are visible from almost every room in the home and enhanced by multiple outdoor fireplaces. Designed for true indoor-outdoor living, the property showcases lush landscaping, an outdoor kitchen, multiple lounging and entertaining areas, out door fireplace and exquisite vintage tile work throughout. The sparkling pool and spa preserve the original 1920s Spanish charm, creating a private oasis. The primary en-suite retreat features a beautiful Spanish-style fireplace, an expansive private patio, and a private balcony overlooking the backyard and pool?nothing short of magnificent. A second kitchen and additional washer and dryer offer excellent flexibility and can easily be configured as in-law quarters or a junior ADU. A rare opportunity to own a piece of Palos Verdes architectural history. Modern Life meets Spanish charm!","Spanish Tile","Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please call or text Karen at  310-995-2622. Private showings only. No lock box.","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","True","3871","Assessor","","CA","Active","Multi/Split ","","","Navajo","","3649","Place","","Spanish","1031 Exchange, Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6887","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Courtyard, Pool, Trees/Woods","True","","","Cu