th three spacious bedrooms & three well-appointed bathrooms. The remodeled kitchen is a true centerpiece, featuring a Wolf 4-burner range with a griddle, a Sub-Zero refrigerator/freezer, and a Bosch dishwasher, making it ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. Natural light fills the home through Pella casement windows and doors, as well as numerous skylights that brighten the interior. The bathrooms are elegantly designed with stunning tilework, marble countertops, and a luxurious Waterworks egg-shaped freestanding tub in the primary suite. Multiple living spaces?including a family room, living room, and dining room?provide flexibility and comfort for both intimate gatherings and larger celebrations. In addition, the property offers a three-car garage, an EV charging station, an enormous laundry room, newer vinyl fencing, and new exterior paint.  The generous lot offers excellent potential for future expansion. The spacious front yard could accommodate a circular driveway (buyer to verify) and provides a perfect setting for outdoor relaxation or picnics. Both the front and rear yards are adjacent to scenic horse trails, adding to the property's unique charm. The backyard is a true highlight, featuring a variety of mature fruit trees, including tangerine, loquat, kumquat, baby guava, macadamia nut, and persimmon. With ample space for entertaining, guests can enjoy gatherings, outdoor parties, and potential pool installation, or practice their short game on the private putting green while taking in city lights and golf course views from the viewing perch. Enjoy the peaceful feel of country-style living with nearby city conveniences. The home is just minutes from restaurants, shopping, schools, beaches, and freeway access for easy commuting. With all these outstanding home features and an assumable 5.5% loan available to qualified buyers, what more could you want?","","Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main F