or California living. The spacious chef?s kitchen serves as the heart of the home, featuring a premium Viking range, stainless steel finishes, generous prep space, and a charming farmhouse sink overlooking a fenced outdoor area ideal for a dog run or a peaceful cup of coffee. The kitchen opens naturally to both indoor gathering areas and outdoor dining for effortless entertaining, featuring three built-in natural gas connection points for heat lamps and a barbecue, allowing for comfortable outdoor gatherings year-round without the need for propane tanks. The primary suite is a true private retreat, offering abundant space, natural light, and French doors with direct access to a secluded outdoor spa hot tub to relax under the night stars.  The newly renovated spa-like master bath features heated floors, refined finishes, and a stand-alone deep soaking tub and a shower with multiple shower heads, designed for relaxation and everyday luxury. True to its classic ranch style, nearly every room features French doors opening to the grounds, creating a bright and airy connection to the outdoors. The resort-style yard includes a sparkling pool with updated plaster and plumbing, along with a detached guest/pool house featuring its own bathroom, air conditioner and flexible use potential. On the opposite side of the guest/pool house, a multi-use sports court overlooks the scenic Chandler Preserve, with direct access from the property to nearby hiking and nature trails, offering a rare opportunity to enjoy open space living and an active outdoor lifestyle right from your backyard. Additional highlights include a finished two-car garage with upgraded flooring, a versatile bonus room located behind the garage ideal for a fitness room, office, or creative space, and a generous garden area currently producing fruits and vegetables. Opportunities to own a private single-level estate with this combination of usable land, indoor-outdoor design, and direct access to preserved open spac