larm System","Assessor","","","PV26054163","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","Shed(s)","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Concrete, Paved, Driveway Level, Garage Faces Front, Garage Faces Side, Garage - Single Door, Garage - Two Door","True","Cabana, Covered, Enclosed, Patio, Patio Open, Front Porch","True","70","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","926.88","Hollywood glamour comes to life in this dazzling designer estate tucked within an exclusive cul-de-sac of just 12 newer homes, adjacent to the prestigious Rolling Hills Country Club and the world-renowned Jack Kramer Tennis Club. Extensively upgraded beyond its original design, the meticulously landscaped lot boasts a beautiful curb appeal and a manicured garden framed by cherry blossom and fruit trees. Inspired by the iconic Beverly Hills Hotel, the interiors showcase designer details such as LED accent lighting, infinity mirrors, custom wallpapers, and resort-style bathrooms. Other distinctive touches such as hand-cut floor tiles and heated bathroom floorings add a layer of refined luxury. Designed for both superb entertaining and lavish living, the home features two enclosed patios that create seamless indoor-outdoor flow to the expansive deck and landscaped grounds. The MAIN LEVEL offers a sophisticated great room for living and gatherings, opening to a charming tea room in the enclosed lanai and sliding doors to the tranquil garden. A formal dining room is complemented by an oversized gourmet kitchen featuring a large center island, Viking appliances, extensive cabinetry, quartz countertops, walk-in pantry as well as a butler?s pantry and a wine storage bar. The primary suite overlooks the lush backyard and includes an expanded walk-in closet, a resort-style bathroom, and direct access to the open deck. An additional en-suite bedroom on the main level provides ideal accommodation for family or guests, while a laundry room and a uniquely designed powder room complete the floor. The LOWER LEVEL is an entertainer?s dream, offering a media room, separate playroom in the lanai, a second powder room, wet bar, and a spacious family room with access to the back. There is also an en-suite bedroom and two generous size bedrooms sharing a full hallway bathroom. Outdoors, the backyard is thoughtfully designed for year-round enjoyment with partial coverage, two outdoor heaters, multiple sitting areas, fire pit, pergola and a gazebo for relaxing or hosting guests. Garden enthusiasts will appreciate the vegetation planters, terraced gardens, and fruit trees that enhance the serene setting. A true showpiece, this dazzling home delivers a lavish lifestyle with a touch of Hollywood glam. Don?t miss this exceptional opportunity to enjoy a distinctive lifestyle!","","Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Recreation, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","Peninsula","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please text my team member, Cindy Carter, at 310-388-2533, your business card and showing date and time. She will confirm the showing with you. PLEASE DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME TO ARRANGE FOR SHOWING.","","","","True","4855","Assessor","","CA","Active","Two","","","Casaba","","9","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","52214","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Golf Course, Trees/Woods","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/490548","","Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, Drapes, ENERGY STAR Qualified Windows, Low Emissivity Windows, Roller Shields","2016","90274","",""
"Entry Slope Less Than 1 Foot, No Interior Steps, Parking","1.1671","Motivated seller.  Appraiser-taped 2,600sf. 2014 addition plans show total square footage of 2,656 sf. Assessor shows 2,380sf.  Building Green articles explaining the home?s unique construction materials are attached with permission from the prior owners & their agent. Plz request video about construction from L/A. Current owner's husband was a Master Gardener. He spent 2-1/2 wonderful years working in the garden & enjoying the fruits of their labor, before peacefully passing away in the home. $2.6M appraisal 4/2024. This home is an amazing value in Rolling Hills! Annual HOA dues are $0.21/$100 ($2,100/million) of the assessed value & are paid at the same time as property taxes. Seller to select services. Broker/Agent does not guarantee accuracy of square footage, lot size, ordinances, zoning, tax assessments, rent control, permits, use code, schools &/or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personal inspection and with appropriate professionals.","Dishwasher, Gas Oven, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator, Water Heater","True","166 - Rolling Hills","Special Assessments","True","7567003021","Pickleball, Outdoor Cooking Area, Picnic Area, Playground, Tennis Court(s), Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Meeting Room, Trash, Pets Permitted, Management, Guard, Security, Controlled Access","2620","","False","3","1","","0","2","3","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","Agent Email","","","","Heat Pump, High Efficiency, See Remarks","True","Los Angeles","266","2495000","#ERR","07/14/2025 6:32:03 AM","","04/01/2026 1:33:37 AM","","04/01/2026 1:35:54 AM","","","07/13/2025 12:00:00 AM","","04/01/2026 1:35:54 AM","","07/13/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","266","French Doors, Sliding Doors","True","B