eticulous design, engineering, and governmental review. The plan's primary residence is a sprawling 12,000-square-foot single-level marvel featuring six en suite bedrooms, three powder rooms, and grand entertaining spaces that flow seamlessly to a private pool and spa. The utility of the expansive property is enhanced by a detached one-bedroom guest house-complete with its own pool and spa-and a world-class wellness structure housing a gym, dry sauna, steam room, and outdoor spa. Designed for the ultimate lifestyle, the plans also include a full-sized tennis court and an equestrian-ready barn featuring two stalls, a tack room, feed room and coral. This is a turnkey invitation to build one of the most significant and secluded estates in coastal Southern California, while retaining the ability to customize finishes and design. The property is being sold as vacant land with approved plans. Photos are renderings from plans. Approved plans and Geological report are available upon request.","","Bonus Room, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Sauna, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text Keith at 310-944-5554 for all showings. DO NOT walk the property without a confirmed appointment.","False","Private, In Ground","True","","13617","Other","","CA","Active","One","","","Saddleback","","80","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","6705","","Single Family Residence","","","Bay, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","","","","2026","90274","",""
