"Accessible Elevator Installed","1.2565","Call or email Keith at 310-944-5554 with any and all questions. HOA dues are $.20 per $100 of assessed value. Payments are broken into 2 per year. Buyer and agent to verify all information provided in the listing. Listing agent does not warrant any information provided.","Barbecue, Built-In Range, Dishwasher","True","166 - Rolling Hills","Unknown","True","7569002016","Pickleball, Tennis Court(s), Paddle Tennis, Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Guard, Security","39600","","False","11","6","","4","1","5","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","Agent Email","","","","Central Air, Zoned","True","Los Angeles","34","19800000","#ERR","03/03/2026 6:50:30 AM","","","","03/19/2026 10:19:01 AM","","","03/03/2026 12:00:00 AM","","03/19/2026 10:19:01 AM","","03/03/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","34","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room, In Kitchen","","","","","","","Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","See Remarks, Stone, Wood","True","Radiant","True","Beamed Ceilings, Dumbwaiter, Elevator, Home Automation System, Open Floorplan, Pantry, Recessed Lighting","True","True","NA","None","False","","","","33.771196","Individual Room, Inside, Laundry Chute","True","False","","","19800000","","","19800000","#ERR","310-707-2124","","keith@palosverdesrealty.com","310-707-2170","Keith","","","Kelley","","VKELLKEI","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.340928","","2","54732","Back Yard, Horse Property Improved, Landscaped, Lot Over 40000 Sqft","Hiking , Horse Trails","Automatic Gate, Security System","Assessor","","","PV26046180","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","Barn(s)","Auto Driveway Gate, Direct Garage Access, Driveway","True","Covered, Patio Open","True","59","","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","2092.36","38 Saddleback in Rolling Hills is an architectural triumph, a 9,400-square-foot Contemporary Ranch nestled on a sprawling 54,732-square-foot lot. Designed by Criss Gunderson with inspiration from Cliff May, the estate?s positioning was guided by two Feng Shui masters to ensure a perfect harmony with its environment. This intentionality is matched by an uncompromising commitment to natural materials, featuring Italian Limestone floors, handmade oak and walnut doors with Rocky Mountain hardware, and the same Hope steel doors found at the Getty Museum. The home offers a dual-kitchen experience designed by Cooper Pacific of Beverly Hills: a sleek contemporary kitchen equipped with Gaggenau and Miele appliances and a ""Entertainment Kitchen"" featuring a handmade La Cornue stove, a Wood Stone pizza oven, and 150-year-old reclaimed barn beams. For the entertainer, the dining room is anchored by a Lindsey Adelman chandelier, while the lower level reveals a Cinema de Cuore theater with custom Fortress seating and a wine cellar constructed from recycled French castle stones and wine-barrel wood. The residence functions as a private sanctuary, offering five bedrooms and nine bathrooms outfitted with elite fixtures from Gessi, Graff, and Axor. The primary suite is a masterclass in luxury, boasting pure white marble walls and Calacata floors. Wellness is central to the design, with a comprehensive spa including an all-cedar dry sauna, steam room with rain shower, massage room, and a soaking tub that transitions to an outdoor shower. Modern convenience is integrated through a laundry chute, a dumbwaiter, and a dedicated library/office located in a separate barn to preserve the sanctity of family life. Outside, the property captures 270-degree panoramic views stretching from Malibu through Los Angeles all the way to Long Beach Harbor, creating an organic flow between the high-design interiors and the breathtaking landscape. This is a home built with conviction, prioritizing craftsmanship, history, and the simple joy of a life well-lived.","","Basement, Bonus Room, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Home Theatre, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Sauna, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text or call Keith Kelley at 310-944-5554 to schedule a showing. DO not approach the property without a confirmed appointment.","","Private, In Ground","True","","9463","Owner","","CA","Active","Two","","","Saddleback","","38","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","23530","","Single Family Residence","","","Bay, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, See Remarks, Water","True","","","","2015","90274","",""
