rea, and abundant natural light from skylights overhead. Additional skylights in the stairwell further enhance the home?s bright and airy feel. Three upstairs bedrooms capture stunning views, offering peaceful retreats with an ever-changing coastal backdrop. Downstairs, you?ll find a spacious family room along with two additional bedrooms, offering flexibility for guests, extended family, a home office, or gym. The large, flat, usable backyard is a rare find ? providing ample room for recreation, gardening, or future possibilities ? all while enjoying privacy and open space behind the property. Additional highlights include dual pane windows, a new AC unit, and a two-car garage. Bring your vision and make this view property your own in one of the area?s most desirable settings.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Formal Entry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Property is vacant. Go direct. Lockbox will be installed on Tuesday before brokers open","True","","","","2398","Assessor","","CA","Active","Multi/Split ","","","Rue Le Charlene","","2222","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27927","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor","True","","","","1969","90275","",""
