"","0.1674","All offers to be accompanied with proof of down payment and closing costs, pre approval letter from Buyers lender or loan broker, including FICO scores. Property is located in the red tile roof Miraleste Section on the Eastside of the Peninsula which is part of the Palos Verdes Estates Homeowner's Association, Art Jury.  Buyer to verify and investigate all requirements to their satisfaction.  Phone # 310-373-6721.","Dishwasher, Disposal, Gas Cooktop, Microwave","True","167 - PV Dr East","Unknown","True","7561009052","Other","0","","False","3","1","","","2","4","4913","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","10","2445000","#ERR","03/27/2026 6:21:53 PM","","","","04/04/2026 7:12:42 AM","","","03/27/2026 12:00:00 AM","","03/27/2026 6:34:49 PM","","03/27/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","10","Double Door Entry","False","In Kitchen, In Living Room","Awning(s), Balcony, Rain Gutters","Unknown","","","","","Family Room, Living Room, Gas Starter","True","","True","Forced Air, Natural Gas","True","Balcony, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Copper Plumbing Full, Intercom, Storage, Vacuum Central","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.745055","Electric Dryer Hookup, Gas Dryer Hookup, Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","","2445000","","","2445000","#ERR","310-831-0222","214","ShariBSells@yahoo.com","","Cheryl","310-972-1612","","Bakotich","310-972-1612","VBAKOCHE","","","310-427-3364","","V7044","310-831-1684","Estate Properties","310-831-0222","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.319784","","1","7294","Landscaped, Lawn, Lot 6500-9999","Hiking , Gutters","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV26065880","","2","2","2","1","Owner","","","","Storage","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Single Door","True","Patio, Patio Open, Front Porch, See Remarks","True","51","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","760.73","Located on one of the most prestigious streets in the Miraleste section of Rancho Palos Verdes, this immaculate custom-built two-story home has been impeccably maintained by its original owners. Built in 1989 and thoughtfully updated in 2024, the home offers an open, airy floor plan surrounded by a breathtaking wooded setting, with beautiful trees and natural scenery visible from nearly every room. Featuring 4 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, with over 3,200 square feet of living space, the home is ideally situated on a 7,292 square foot lot. It has been a 100% tobacco & pet-free home since it was built. Entry Level The home welcomes you with iron and glass double front doors leading into a spacious foyer with travertine floors and matching granite accents. The living room features walls of glass, a fireplace, and vaulted ceilings, and sits adjacent to a large formal dining room. The updated kitchen showcases rich raw umberstained hardwood cabinetry, granite countertops, a butcher block island, and newer stainless-steel appliances. The eat-in kitchen opens to a private deck, perfect for barbecues and outdoor dining. Also on the main level is a guest powder room and a large family room with a fireplace, vaulted ceilings with track lighting, hardwood floors, its own private deck, and spectacular views of Miraleste Canyon. Lower Level Downstairs features four spacious bedrooms, including a large primary suite with dual walk-in closets and a private patio. The primary bathroom offers a soaking tub, separate shower, and dual vanity sinks. A generous laundry room with utility sink is also located on this level. Additional Features Central vacuum system, dual-zone heating and air conditioning, wired for alarm, Kohler and American Standard plumbing fixtures, recently painted in designer colors, new carpeting, French doors, underground utilities, AM/FM intercom system, and an oversized 2.5-car garage with additional storage space accessible from the exterior north side of the home. The property also includes drought-tolerant landscaping and a water-saving drip irrigation system. Conveniently located near top-rated Palos Verdes schools, shopping, banks, restaurants, hospitals, and gas stations, with easy access to the 110 freeway.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Basement, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Utility Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Seller requests 3 hour notice to show.  All showings are with Listing Agent, Shari B.  DO NOT use showing time. Call Shari B at 310-972-1612.","True","None","False","","3214","Assessor","","CA","Active","Two","","","Via Colinita","","6616","","","Custom Built","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7145","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Hills, Park/Greenbelt, Trees/Woods","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/490908","","Blinds","1989","90275","",""
