 black-and-white Dalmatian marble, a generous island, Rohl fixtures, and a full suite of Viking appliances including a 6-burner range, double ovens, Sub-Zero refrigerator, and dual dishwashers.  Two separate bedroom wings offer privacy and flexibility. The harbor-view primary suite is a retreat of its own, featuring a fireplace, vaulted beams, spa-style bath with soaking tub and skylight, and a custom walk-in dressing room. The secondary wing provides four additional bedrooms or adaptable office and gym space. A large laundry room with dual Samsung washer/dryer sets adds everyday convenience.  The detached 540? sq ft ADU has a bedroom, kitchen/dining area, and mini-split HVAC offering ideal space for guests, multigenerational living, or rental use.  A rare combination of privacy and views, this turn-key home offers a refined yet relaxed coastal lifestyle.","","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appointment and CBS code:  310.704.5164","","","","","4138","Estimated","","CA","Active","One","","","Palos Verdes Drive East","","28056","","","Modern","Cash to New Loan","","20","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Panoramic","True","","","","1955","90275","",""
