","","","","","","","","36","","None","False","","950.87","Luxury Live Auction! Bidding to start from $1,800,000! Experience elevated coastal living in this fully reimagined 5-bedroom, 3.5-bath residence in the prestigious Palos Verdes Estates of Rancho Palos Verdes. Rebuilt from the ground up with a modern coastal design, the home showcases clean architectural lines, high-end finishes, and thoughtfully curated spaces designed for today?s lifestyle. Vaulted ceilings and expansive open-concept living areas create a bright, airy atmosphere filled with natural light. The chef?s kitchen anchors the home with an oversized island, custom cabinetry, oyster-shell ceramic backsplash, premium stainless steel appliances, and seamless flow into the dining and living areas, ideal for entertaining and everyday living. The flexible layout includes two primary suites and versatile spaces suited for a home office, media room, fitness studio, or multi-generational living. Designer details throughout include white oak engineered flooring, porcelain tile accents, and a striking marble feature wall in the spa-inspired primary bath. Bathrooms are appointed with floating vanities, walk-in showers, and contemporary finishes. Set on a spacious corner lot, the property provides room to create a private outdoor retreat?whether a future pool, outdoor kitchen, or entertaining space, enhanced by cool coastal breezes and a charming peek-a-boo ocean view. A southwest-facing orientation captures beautiful sunsets, and an oversized two-car garage with EV charging adds modern convenience. Ideally located near coastal trails, parks, top-rated schools, dining, and shopping, this turnkey ocean-view home embodies luxury, comfort, and an exceptional coastal setting.","Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Great Room, Kitchen, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please call to set a time to show. 949-275-7982","","","","True","1893","Assess