erter), 2.0 generator integrated in solar system. 250 Gallon propane tank, 3 tankless water heaters. Property is located in the neighborhood affected by land movement and impacted by it?..for latest landslide updates ,visit: RPVCA.GOV/LANDMOVEMENT. Gas and SCE company disconnected servis for this area about year ago,  now all is working by solar, generator, butan tank.... This is probably the most beautiful piece of land in Portuguese bend ,providing privacy and breathtaking views !","","Art Studio, Entry, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar, Workshop","","Palo Verde Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text Lida 310-721-3196.  BOM . Showing will be possible ONLY after proof of all cash for purchase will be provided . Please see photos in Supplements and share with your clients.","False","None","False","True","2000","Assessor","","CA","Active","One","","","Thyme","","1","","","Custom Built, Ranch","Cash","","14-500","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Other, Propane, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Canyon, Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Blinds, Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, Drapes, Insulated Windows, Roller Shields, Skylight(s)","1950","90275","",""
