ered pergola. Additional features include a two-car garage, a generous front parking pad, and a paverd driveway. Within this private neighboorhood, you'll have have the benefit of enjoying  a heightened sense of privacy, security, and exclusivity. This area of Rancho Palos Verdes is also known for having one of the best micro climates on the Peninsula.Residents of Abalone Cove benefit from private gated access to Abalone Cove Shoreline Park, known for its sea caves, tide pools rich with marine life, and frequent sightings of seals and dolphins. Just a short drive to Terranea Resort, local shopping at Golden Cove shopping center and just around the corner of numerous scenic hiking trails.","","Living Room","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Call LA1 for showings. Easy to show but need 24 hr notice. Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Call LA 1 ","","None","False","","1631","","","CA","Active","One","","","Packet","","26","Road","","Mid Century Modern","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Hills","True","","","","1954","90275","5828","RPRS10000SP*"
