hroughout, and upgraded outlets. Inside, the home showcases all-new scratch-resistant flooring, custom closets in every bedroom, and fully remodeled bathrooms featuring elegant finishes, glass shower enclosures, double showerheads, and enhanced storage. Both the living room and family room are anchored by stunning stone fireplaces, replacing the original brick for a more sophisticated, modern aesthetic. The heart of the home is a beautifully redesigned kitchen, complete with a 48-inch BlueStar range with eight burners, new dishwasher, farmhouse sink, wine fridge with dual temperature control, and thoughtfully curated finishes?perfect for both everyday living and entertaining. Seamless indoor-outdoor living is achieved through a panoramic door that opens from the family room to a spectacular backyard retreat. The expansive, flat yard offers breathtaking ocean views, a large pool with diving board, an outdoor bathroom and ample space for entertaining, relaxing, or creating your dream outdoor environment. Tankless water heater, LifeSource whole-house water filtration system, New washer and dryer hookups, Smart door lock system, Fully integrated security system with six hardwired, night-vision exterior cameras plus Ring cameras in front and back, Surround sound system in the living room, backyard, and garage. The garage has been transformed into the ultimate man cave and fitness retreat, featuring rubber gym flooring, space for equipment and weights, and multiple large-screen TVs?ideal for sports enthusiasts or private training. With all doors replaced, high-end upgrades throughout, and a seamless blend of technology and design. A rare offering combining quality craftsmanship, modern amenities, and incredible outdoor living with ocean views.  Walk to Ladera Linda community center for a walk around the track, pickle ball, basketball or for the amazing views. Close to ward winning schools, restaurants and Trump Golf Club.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Mai