ed Driveway","True","Covered, Patio, Patio Open, Front Porch","True","47","","None","False","","844.2","Experience modern luxury living in this ONE LEVEL custom-built SINGLE FAMILY RESIDENCE with PANORAMIC Pacific Ocean, Catalina Island, sunrise and sunset views, with no HOA dues! This exceptional home offers peace, privacy, and seamless indoor-outdoor living, with breathtaking vistas enjoyed from the primary suite, living and formal dining room. Recent upgrades include a solar system with two Tesla batteries, a smart-home system, sound-proof windows/sliding doors, recessed lighting, electric shades, and refinished wood flooring. Architectural details such as arched doorways and beamed cathedral ceilings add distinctive character while filling the house with natural light. The living room is ideal for entertaining, featuring an accordion door that opens wide to a front ocean-view private patio with outdoor seating, a fire pit, and an ice cooler. It effortlessly transitions from an ideal setting for fun gatherings with a nearby TV to a private retreat for morning coffee or evening wine, framed by mesmerizing ocean views and the warm glow of a fire pit. The spacious chef?s kitchen has many updated appliances, lots of cabinets and counter space and a large center island with vegetable sink. It opens to both the formal dining room with ocean views and a large family room with fireplace and surround sound. This well-designed home places all bedrooms on one wing. The primary suite includes a sitting area to take in the mesmerizing views, a cozy fireplace, and a walk-in closet. The second en-suite bedroom offers additional privacy with its own bath and a generous mirrored closet. Two additional bedrooms are well sized with ample closet space, and share a full hallway bathroom. A walk-in pantry/storage closet, powder room, and laundry room add everyday convenience. Accessible from the foyer, family room, and a secondary bedroom, a secluded central courtyard further enhances the indoor-outdoor lifestyle with a built-in BBQ and water fountain. The landscaped backyard has a grassy area, surrounded by avocado and peach trees. There are also 2 sheds for storage, and a freestanding shed for a home office, gym, or creative space. A covered carport and EV charger add extra value to this coastal retreat. Located in the top-rated Palos Verdes unified school district and close to ocean trails & Terranea Resort, this home offers exceptional access to outdoor recreation and coastal amenities. Don?t miss the opportunity to enjoy Southern CA coastal living at its finest!","","Entry, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","For all showings, please text my team member, Cindy Carter, at 310-388-2533, your business card and the showing date and time. The property is still occupied by the Seller. Overnight notice is preferred, or at least 4 hour notice if on the same day. PLEASE DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME.","","","","True","2837","Assessor","","CA","Active","One","","","Seawolf","","32508","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","6706","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/490632","","Double Pane Windows, Insulated Windows, Screens, Skylight(s)","2000","90275","",""
