nto the surrounding living spaces.  The primary suite offers its own ocean-view balcony, a spacious walk-in closet, and a well-appointed bathroom with dual vanity sinks, a dedicated makeup vanity, soaking tub, and walk-in shower. On the lower level, three additional bedrooms are complemented by two full bathrooms, including one with dual sinks, along with a dedicated laundry room. The backyard has been completely reimagined into a true entertainer?s dream. Remodeled in 2025 and spanning three tiers, this resort-style setting features a view-facing jacuzzi, fire pit, outdoor bar and kitchen with grill and smoker, and a covered pavilion with fireplace. The side yard includes a thoughtfully designed pet area, conveniently located next to the trash bins for easy cleanup. New pavers, fresh landscaping, and artificial turf throughout the front, back, and side yards provide a clean, low-maintenance finish, while additional undeveloped land offers future possibilities. Additional improvements include updated plumbing, fresh exterior paint, new garage door, and a highly versatile garage/bonus space that can function as a large flex room?perfect for a gym, game room, workshop, or additional living area?or accommodate up to four vehicles. Located near scenic coastal trails, Point Vicente Lighthouse & Interpretive Center, Golden Cove Shopping Center, Terranea Resort, and situated in the Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this home offers the very best of Palos Verdes living.","","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call John with a few hours notice (310) 293-9906. Lockbox on front railing.","True","Private","True","","3470","Assessor","","CA","Active","Two","","","Nuvola","","33","Court","","Mediterranean, Spanish","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","45667","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","https://www.youtube.com/w