w ideal for everyday living and entertaining. A spacious great room features a dramatic accordion-style window that frames the ocean and opens wide to let in fresh coastal breezes. A stylish wet bar cozy adds charm. The chef's kitchen is both functional and refined, showcasing granite countertops, a center island with leathered stone, and a newly installed Hestan professional-grade range.A formal dining room captures spectacular Catalina views, creating a memorable backdrop for dinners and gatherings. Nearby, the formal living room offers another inviting space to relax and enjoy the scenery by the fireplace. A powder room and separate laundry room complete the main level, along with two bedrooms on the main floor sharing a beautifully remodeled bathroom. Upstairs, the private primary suite feels like a peaceful retreat above the coastline, with panoramic ocean views and a spa-like bathroom featuring a soaking tub positioned to take in the horizon. An adjacent office or optional fourth bedroom opens to its own private deck.The oversized front yard feels like a park, shaded by mature trees and offering generous outdoor space. Additional highlights include a three-car garage, a large driveway, and access to popular nearby hiking trails and Del Cerro Park. Located near top-rated schools and quiet streets, this exceptional home offers privacy, beauty, and the best of coastal living.","Spanish Tile","Den, Entry, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call or text Chelby to set up a showing, then go directly. (626) 536-2002","True","None","False","True","3428","Assessor","","CA","Active","Two","","","Burrell","","8","Lane","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Submit","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1984","90275","",""
